<section class="aq-section aq-section--alt aq-shop-route-sec"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l"><header class="aq-sec-head"><h2 class="aq-h1">From pipe to turnover</h2><p class="aq-lead">A joint inside a finished skid is hard to re-inspect.</p></header><div class="aq-shop-route" data-theme="light" style="--cols:3;--rows:2"><div class="aq-shop-route__route" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-shop-route__seg aq-shop-route__seg--a"></span><span class="aq-shop-route__seg aq-shop-route__seg--b"></span><span class="aq-shop-route__seg aq-shop-route__seg--c"></span><span class="aq-shop-route__gate" style="left:33.333%"></span><span class="aq-shop-route__spool"></span></div><ol class="aq-shop-route__bays"><li class="aq-shop-route__bay is-hold" style="grid-row:1;grid-column:1;--i:0"><svg class="aq-shop-route__furn" viewBox="0 0 136 116" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect class="aq-shop-route__ln" x="10" y="20" width="70" height="40"></rect><path class="aq-shop-route__thin" d="M18 30H60M18 38H52M18 46H64"></path><circle class="aq-shop-route__ln" cx="45" cy="74" r="10"></circle><rect class="aq-shop-route__sheet" x="90" y="24" width="40" height="52"></rect><path class="aq-shop-route__thin" d="M98 34H122M98 42H116M98 50H124"></path></svg><span class="aq-shop-route__n" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3 class="aq-shop-route__t">Fabrication and inspection plan</h3><p class="aq-shop-route__d">Agreed before material is ordered: standards, inspection extent, records, hold and witness points.</p><p class="aq-shop-route__tags"><span class="aq-shop-route__stamp"><span class="aq-shop-route__stamp-k">Hold point</span> <span>Signed by both parties</span></span></p><span class="aq-shop-route__stop" aria-hidden="true"></span></li><li class="aq-shop-route__bay" style="grid-row:1;grid-column:2;--i:1"><svg class="aq-shop-route__furn" viewBox="0 0 136 116" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect class="aq-shop-route__ln" x="6" y="14" width="124" height="6"></rect><rect class="aq-shop-route__ln" x="6" y="25" width="124" height="6"></rect><rect class="aq-shop-route__ln" x="6" y="36" width="124" height="6"></rect><rect class="aq-shop-route__ln" x="6" y="47" width="124" height="6"></rect><rect class="aq-shop-route__ln" x="6" y="58" width="124" height="6"></rect><rect class="aq-shop-route__ln" x="6" y="69" width="124" height="6"></rect><rect class="aq-shop-route__thin" x="14" y="84" width="40" height="24"></rect><path class="aq-shop-route__thin" d="M14 96H54M34 84V108"></path><rect class="aq-shop-route__thin" x="70" y="84" width="40" height="24"></rect><path class="aq-shop-route__thin" d="M70 96H110M90 84V108"></path></svg><span class="aq-shop-route__n" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3 class="aq-shop-route__t">Receive and verify material</h3><p class="aq-shop-route__d">Each PP lot checked against its certificate and logged.</p><p class="aq-shop-route__tags"></p><span class="aq-shop-route__stop" aria-hidden="true"></span></li><li class="aq-shop-route__bay is-wit is-rc" style="grid-row:1;grid-column:3;--i:2"><svg class="aq-shop-route__furn" viewBox="0 0 136 116" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect class="aq-shop-route__ln" x="8" y="20" width="120" height="46"></rect><path class="aq-shop-route__fix" d="M30 36H52C60 36 62 50 70 50H96"></path><path class="aq-shop-route__fix" d="M30 44H50C58 44 60 58 70 58H96"></path><circle class="aq-shop-route__ln" cx="112" cy="88" r="12"></circle><path class="aq-shop-route__thin" d="M112 88L120 80"></path></svg><span class="aq-shop-route__n" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3 class="aq-shop-route__t">Qualify the set-up</h3><p class="aq-shop-route__d">Test joints made and accepted before any production joint.</p><p class="aq-shop-route__tags"><span class="aq-shop-route__wit">Witness point</span></p><span class="aq-shop-route__stop" aria-hidden="true"></span></li><li class="aq-shop-route__bay is-wit is-back is-rc" style="grid-row:2;grid-column:3;--i:3"><svg class="aq-shop-route__furn" viewBox="0 0 136 116" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect class="aq-shop-route__ln" x="4" y="34" width="128" height="30"></rect><rect class="aq-shop-route__sheet" x="16" y="26" width="12" height="46"></rect><rect class="aq-shop-route__sheet" x="34" y="26" width="12" height="46"></rect><rect class="aq-shop-route__sheet" x="84" y="26" width="12" height="46"></rect><rect class="aq-shop-route__sheet" x="102" y="26" width="12" height="46"></rect><path class="aq-shop-route__fix" d="M0 49H62M70 49H136"></path><path class="aq-shop-route__ln" d="M66 38V60"></path><rect class="aq-shop-route__ln" x="52" y="82" width="28" height="22"></rect><path class="aq-shop-route__thin" d="M58 90H74M58 96H70"></path></svg><span class="aq-shop-route__n" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3 class="aq-shop-route__t">Join, record and inspect</h3><p class="aq-shop-route__d">Each joint numbered and logged with its parameters; visual examination. Rejects cut out, renumbered.</p><p class="aq-shop-route__tags"><span class="aq-shop-route__wit">Witness point</span></p><span class="aq-shop-route__stop" aria-hidden="true"></span></li><li class="aq-shop-route__bay is-wit is-back" style="grid-row:2;grid-column:2;--i:4"><svg class="aq-shop-route__furn" viewBox="0 0 136 116" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path class="aq-shop-route__fix" d="M8 40H100V90H40"></path><rect class="aq-shop-route__ln" x="2" y="32" width="10" height="16"></rect><rect class="aq-shop-route__ln" x="34" y="84" width="10" height="16"></rect><circle class="aq-shop-route__ln" cx="114" cy="40" r="14"></circle><path class="aq-shop-route__thin" d="M114 40L122 31M104 40H100"></path><path class="aq-shop-route__thin" d="M60 100V114M52 114H68"></path></svg><span class="aq-shop-route__n" aria-hidden="true">05</span><h3 class="aq-shop-route__t">Test and survey</h3><p class="aq-shop-route__d">Pressure test, slope survey and dead leg check.</p><p class="aq-shop-route__tags"><span class="aq-shop-route__wit">Witness point</span></p><span class="aq-shop-route__stop" aria-hidden="true"></span></li><li class="aq-shop-route__bay is-back" style="grid-row:2;grid-column:1;--i:5"><svg class="aq-shop-route__furn" viewBox="0 0 136 116" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle class="aq-shop-route__ln" cx="34" cy="40" r="26"></circle><path class="aq-shop-route__fix" d="M60 40H96C110 40 110 70 96 76"></path><path class="aq-shop-route__thin" d="M88 86L96 76L104 86"></path><rect class="aq-shop-route__door" x="4" y="92" width="124" height="10"></rect></svg><span class="aq-shop-route__n" aria-hidden="true">06</span><h3 class="aq-shop-route__t"><a class="aq-steps__go" href="#cmp-documentation#index" data-wp="cmp-documentation#index">Clean and turn over</a></h3><p class="aq-shop-route__d">Flushed and rinsed with PW before factory acceptance testing. Dossier indexed by joint number, updated with field joints.</p><p class="aq-shop-route__tags"></p><span class="aq-shop-route__stop" aria-hidden="true"></span></li></ol><span class="aq-shop-route__door aq-shop-route__door--in" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="aq-shop-route__door aq-shop-route__door--out" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></section>
